{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Also you.</b> To include Aaron and Hur. One wonders, for Hur was killed in the episode of the calf, as Rashi explained in פרשת כי תשא regarding ״ויבן מזבח לפניו״ — he reads it as מזבוח לפניו. And one may answer that this derasha follows the one who says Jethro was before the giving of the Torah, for Hur had not yet been killed."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:22.873659952Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}